what The perturbation probe skipped three of nine candidates for no tracked family control, and that one word covered three different states. Each of the three holds a family instrument by ROLE rather than by NAME: tools_py_ban plants context/fixtures/tools_py_ban_tree/tools/planted.py and hands its selftest a TOOLS_PY_SCAN_ROOT override, so the plant sits in a root the living find never walks; copy_sameness plants context/fixtures/copy_sameness_drift/tally_copy_drifted.rye under a basename the scan's own find -name tally_copy.rye excludes; living_docs_lint holds no plant at all, only a roster and a keeps allowlist, which are INPUTS rather than plants. Replace family_control with family_instrument resolving control then plant, print which kind resolved, and split the skip into no_family_instrument distinct from the control case. Then name the doors a family uses to keep its own plant out of its own field.
